## Objective

Finalize the medical image segmentation project by organizing the repository, documenting the workflow, and summarizing model performance.

## Summary

During Week 6, the project was completed by integrating all previous work into a well-organized GitHub repository. A workflow diagram and a performance comparison chart were created to visualize the complete segmentation pipeline and the improvement achieved after fine-tuning. The project documentation and README were also updated to improve readability and reproducibility.

## Results

- Mean Dice: **0.8649**
- Mean IoU: **0.8179**

The fine-tuned U-Net model achieved better segmentation performance than the baseline model, demonstrating the effectiveness of data augmentation and continued training.
